    "title": "Fort Drum Soldiers Ruck Together for Suicide Prevention Month - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By David Laguerre ,\n21 hours ago FORT DRUM, N.Y. — More than 80 Fort Drum soldiers took to the Remington Park trails on Sept. 24 for a ruck march with a mission beyond physical training: strengthening connections and encouraging open conversations about suicide prevention. In support of Fort Drum suicide prevention efforts, this event highlighted... Read full article\n1",
